OL,3,AApple unsure when it will get more
OL,4,Afoldable iPhones ahead of Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple has said it does not know when it
OL,7,Fwill get more of its new foldable
OL,8,FiPhones back in stock as the company
OL,9,Fheads towards the key Christmas trading
OL,10,Fperiod.
OL,12,FThe iPhone Duo sold out just over a
OL,13,Fweek after its launch, despite being
OL,14,FApple's most expensive smartphone at a
OL,15,Fcost of nearly $2,000.
OL,17,FThe company warned of "constraints" in
OL,18,Fsourcing key components and admitted it
OL,19,Fwas "really hard to predict when supply
OL,20,Fand demand will be in balance".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
